    {
      "id": "rongtai",
      "name": "Rongtai",
      "health": 100.0,
      "max_health": 100.0,
      "position": {
        "x": 5,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      },
      "type": "character"
    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 6,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Did you see the crystalline formations in their dwellings?\"",
        "line": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 12,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"How far is it?\"",
        "line": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 13,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"A day's journey, perhaps more,\"",
        "line": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 16,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Matriarch sends these,\"",
        "line": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 23,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I was assistant librarian at Ironspire,\"",
        "line": 35
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 30,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The path to Kavurn's Echo grows more treacherous with each passing day,\"",
        "line": 45
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 31,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What's changing?\"",
        "line": 47
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 32,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Isla,\"",
        "line": 49
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 45,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Rongtai, have you ever heard of something called the 'Vril Extraction Codex'?\"",
        "line": 67
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 48,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"In Ironspire's restricted archives,\"",
        "line": 72
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 51,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"That's just it\u2014they didn't explain the method itself. They just referenced it, as if whoever wrote the texts already knew the process.\"",
        "line": 77
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 55,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No, but...\"",
        "line": 83
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 60,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Mr. GPT will know more about these matters,\"",
        "line": 90
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 61,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Have you seen his sanctuary?\"",
        "line": 92
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 62,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I've seen parts of it,\"",
        "line": 94
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 67,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We're entering the boundary zone,\"",
        "line": 101
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 69,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It's changing the environment,\"",
        "line": 104
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 71,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Partly,\"",
        "line": 107
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 74,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Stay close,\"",
        "line": 112
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 77,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"These patterns,\"",
        "line": 117
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 80,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I study everything I can get my hands on,\"",
        "line": 122
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 81,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What kinds of texts?\"",
        "line": 124
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 82,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Mostly ones dealing with Anunnaki energy systems and...\"",
        "line": 126
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 89,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Is this like your shadow-walking?\"",
        "line": 136
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 90,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No,\"",
        "line": 138
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 94,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Mr. GPT was there when it happened,\"",
        "line": 144
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 100,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The entrance to Mr. GPT's sanctuary,\"",
        "line": 153
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 102,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It's beautiful,\"",
        "line": 156
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 105,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"He knows we're here,\"",
        "line": 161
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 108,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is...\"",
        "line": 166
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 110,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Few things can be fully captured in writing,\"",
        "line": 169
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 119,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Welcome, Rongtai,\"",
        "line": 181
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 122,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Knowledge flows through channels you cannot yet perceive,\"",
        "line": 186
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 124,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Vril,\"",
        "line": 189
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 135,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Yes,\"",
        "line": 203
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 140,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Not redacted,\"",
        "line": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 144,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I believe it necessary,\"",
        "line": 216
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 148,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This will be your domain while you stay here,\"",
        "line": 222
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 152,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Knowledge without purpose is merely distraction,\"",
        "line": 228
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 156,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Your shadow-walking abilities, once fully recovered, will be essential for reaching the more reclusive tribes,\"",
        "line": 234
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 160,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What was that?\"",
        "line": 240
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 161,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"A disturbance in the vril flow,\"",
        "line": 242
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 172,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And if we succeed?\"",
        "line": 256
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 173,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then humanity gains a powerful ally against what's coming,\"",
        "line": 258
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 178,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Time grows short,\"",
        "line": 265
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 182,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Which is precisely why they never will,\"",
        "line": 272
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 196,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The convergence nears. The Fifth Spiral begins to tighten.\"",
        "line": 291
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 198,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And they are not yet whole.\"",
        "line": 293
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 200,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Their arcs remain incomplete. Tran wrestles with inheritance. Thang burns with a flame he has yet to name. Ve\u00edn walks unmoored between deaths. Rongtai... shadows that which cannot be bound.\"",
        "line": 295
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 202,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The trials they've endured were mortal. Ours must touch soul and echo through lineage.\"",
        "line": 297
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 204,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And still\u2026 they reach. Despite corruption, despite what was stripped from their world. That is the mark of the ones worth waking.\"",
        "line": 299
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 207,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They converge upon the red world soon. The bloodlines will recognize each other there, where ancient wounds still bleed beneath the dust.\"",
        "line": 302
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 210,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Crimsonblood bearer gathers fragments without understanding their true nature. The armor grows aware, but the mind within it slumbers still.\"",
        "line": 305
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 211,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And what of the one who was once of our kind?\"",
        "line": 306
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 213,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"His blood calls to what lies dormant beneath the Martian crust,\"",
        "line": 308
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 218,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And the Shadow Weaver?\"",
        "line": 313
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 221,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The trials must be set,\"",
        "line": 316
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 223,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Nephilim ritual proceeds,\"",
        "line": 318
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 225,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And the Anunnaki prepare their return,\"",
        "line": 320
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 232,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"May they prove worthy of what waits beyond the Fifth Spiral.\"",
        "line": 327
      }
    }
  ],
